    "text": "actionnewsnow.com\nwebsite\nChico\nCity of Chico to hand out seven-day notices at three locations where homeless people were found to be camping\nBy Will Anderson,\n23 hours agoCHICO, Calif. - The City of Chico announced Tuesday their intentions to enforce its anti-camping ordinances by handing out seven-day notices at three different locations around the City of Chico pursuant to Paragraph 10C) of the Warren v City of Chico Homeless Settlement Agreement. Officials say that the enforcement will...\n5",
